  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Consider a circular coil of wire carrying constant current <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> forming a magnetic dipole. The magnetic flux through an infinite plane that contains the circular coil and excluding the circular coil area is given by <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></math> The magnetic flux through the area of the circular coil area is given by <math><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> . Which of the following option is correct?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "tKbJj",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Fta83",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5USPb",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zZ82V",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "As magnetic field lines always form a closed loop, hence every magnetic field line creating magnetic flux in the inner region must be passing through the outer region. Since flux in two regions are in opposite direction.<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>&#981;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
    "image": null
  },
